lood pressure is 116/90, and his weight is 143 pounds. He has been diagnosed with Parkinson's disease, which began when he was 74 years old. Mr. Copeland reports feeling stable and has not experienced any major complications. His motor symptoms are well-managed, and we reviewed his treatment plan during this visit.\n\nMay 13, 2022: Mr. Copeland visited today for a follow-up appointment concerning his Parkinson's disease. His blood pressure is 114/91, and his weight is 155 pounds. He is doing well and reports feeling stable overall. His motor symptoms are under control, and there have been no sign"
